<!doctype html><html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Recrutement — Suicide Crew</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/style.css"></head><body><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="../index.html"><span class="brand-mark"><span>SC</span></span><span class="brand-copy"><strong>SUICIDE</strong><em>CREW</em><small>HONOR OF KINGS</small></span></a><nav class="main-nav"><a href="../index.html">Accueil</a><a href="equipe.html">La Team</a><a href="matchs.html">Matchs</a><a href="exploits.html">Exploits</a><a href="live.html">Live</a><a href="classement.html">Classement</a><a class="active" href="recrutement.html">Recrutement</a><a href="connexion.html">Connexion</a></nav></header><main class="subpage section-shell"><p class="eyebrow">05 / recrutement</p><h1 class="page-title">Ta place est<br><em>peut-être ici.</em></h1><p class="page-intro">Tu joues pour gagner, mais surtout pour progresser ? Envoie-nous ta candidature.</p><div class="standalone-form"><form class="page-form" data-demo-form><label>Pseudo<input required placeholder="Ton pseudo"></label><label>Rôle recherché<select required><option value="">Sélectionner</option><option>Jungle</option><option>Mid</option><option>Support</option><option>ADC</option><option>Solo lane</option></select></label><label>Message<textarea required placeholder="Parle-nous de toi…"></textarea></label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Envoyer ma candidature <span>↗</span></button></form></div></main><script src="../js/app.js"></script></body></html>